  "editEditor": "<div role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="ready-message-editor-title" tabindex="-1" class="overflow-y-auto bg-white shadow-2xl relative popin overflow-x-hidden scrollbar-slim outline-none p-5 pb-[calc(env(safe-area-inset-bottom,0px)+1.25rem)] w-full max-w-[640px] max-h-[85dvh] rounded-t-2xl anim-slide-down motion-reduce:animation-none"><div aria-hidden="true" class="mx-auto mb-4 h-1 w-10 rounded-full bg-gray-300"></div><div class="mb-4 flex items-center justify-between gap-3"><h2 id="ready-message-editor-title" class="text-lg font-bold text-ink">עריכת הודעה</h2><button type="button" aria-label="סגירה" class="-me-1 flex size-11 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full text-gray-500 hover:bg-gray-100 focus:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-primary"><span aria-hidden="true" class="text-2xl leading-none">×</span></button></div><form class="flex flex-col gap-4" aria-labelledby="ready-message-editor-title"><p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-gray-500">יצירת גרסה חדשה לבדיקה. ההודעה הנוכחית תישאר פעילה עד שהגרסה החדשה תאושר — אפשר להעביר אותה לארכיון לאחר מכן.</p><label class="grid gap-1.5"><span class="text-sm font-medium text-ink">שם ההודעה</span><input class="h-11 w-full rounded-md border border-gray-200 bg-white px-3 text-base focus:outline-2 focus:outline-offset-0 focus:outline-primary" placeholder="למשל: תזכורת פולואפ" value="תזכורת פגישה"></label><label class="grid gap-1.5"><span class="text-sm font-medium text-ink">תוכן ההודעה</span><textarea rows="5" class="min-h-24 w-full resize-none rounded-md border border-gray-200 bg-white p-3 text-base focus:outline-2 focus:outline-offset-0 focus:outline-primary" placeholder="כתבו את ההודעה שתישלח ללידים...">היי {{שם הליד}}, מזכירים את הפגישה מחר.</textarea></label><div><p class="mb-2 text-sm text-gray-500">הוספת פרטים אישיים</p><div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2"><button type="button" class="press flex min-h-11 items-center rounded-full border border-primary/30 bg-primary-tint px-4 text-sm text-primary-text hover:bg-primary-tint/70 focus:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-primary">שם הליד</button><button type="button" class="press flex min-h-11 items-center rounded-full border border-primary/30 bg-primary-tint px-4 text-sm text-primary-text hover:bg-primary-tint/70 focus:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-primary">שם העסק</button></div></div><fieldset class="grid gap-2"><legend class="text-sm font-medium text-ink">מה מטרת ההודעה?</legend><label class="flex min-h-11 items-center gap-3 rounded-md border px-3 border-primary bg-primary-tint/40"><input class="size-4" type="radio" value="UTILITY" checked="" name="template-purpose"><span class="text-sm text-ink">עדכון או תזכורת לליד <span class="text-gray-400">(סטטוס, תזכורת, מענה)</span></span></label><label class="flex min-h-11 items-center gap-3 rounded-md border px-3 border-gray-200 bg-white"><input class="size-4" type="radio" value="MARKETING" name="template-purpose"><span class="text-sm text-ink">מבצע או הצעה שיווקית <span class="text-gray-400">(קופון, מבצע, השקה)</span></span></label></fieldset><p class="text-sm text-gray-500">פרטים שיוחלפו בשליחה: שם הליד</p><div><p class="mb-1.5 text-sm text-gray-500">כך הליד יראה את ההודעה</p><div class="rounded-lg p-3 bg-bg bg-[radial-gradient(var(--color-primary-soft)_1px,transparent_1px)] bg-size-[16px_16px]" aria-hidden="true"><div class="flex justify-end"><div class="max-w-[85%] rounded-2xl rounded-se-none border border-success-border bg-success-bg px-3 py-1.5"><p class="min-w-0 text-sm leading-normal whitespace-pre-wrap wrap-break-word text-gray-800">היי {{דוד}}, מזכירים את הפגישה מחר.</p></div></div></div></div><button type="submit" class="press flex min-h-11 w-full items-center justify-center rounded-md bg-solid font-medium text-white hover:bg-solid/85 disabled:opacity-60 focus:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-primary">שלח לבדיקה</button><button type="button" class="press flex min-h-11 w-full items-center justify-center rounded-md border border-gray-200 bg-white font-medium text-ink hover:bg-gray-50 focus:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-primary">ביטול</button></form></div>",
  "editorEmpty": "<div role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="ready-message-editor-title" tabindex="-1" class="overflow-y-auto bg-white shadow-2xl relative popin overflow-x-hidden scrollbar-slim outline-none p-5 pb-[calc(env(safe-area-inset-bottom,0px)+1.25rem)] w-full max-w-[640px] max-h-[85dvh] rounded-t-2xl anim-slide-down motion-reduce:animation-none"><div aria-hidden="true" class="mx-auto mb-4 h-1 w-10 rounded-full bg-gray-300"></div><div class="mb-4 flex items-center justify-between gap-3"><h2 id="ready-message-editor-title" class="text-lg font-bold text-ink">הודעה מוכנה חדשה</h2><button type="button" aria-label="סגירה" class="-me-1 flex size-11 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full text-gray-500 hover:bg-gray-100 focus:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-primary"><span aria-hidden="true" class="text-2xl leading-none">×</span></button></div><form class="flex flex-col gap-4" aria-labelledby="ready-message-editor-title"><label class="grid gap-1.5"><span class="text-sm font-medium text-ink">שם ההודעה</span><input class="h-11 w-full rounded-md border border-gray-200 bg-white px-3 text-base focus:outline-2 focus:outline-offset-0 focus:outline-primary" placeholder="למשל: תזכורת פולואפ" value=""></label><label class="grid gap-1.5"><span class="text-sm font-medium text-ink">תוכן ההודעה</span><textarea rows="5" class="min-h-24 w-full resize-none rounded-md border border-gray-200 bg-white p-3 text-base focus:outline-2 focus:outline-offset-0 focus:outline-primary" placeholder="כתבו את ההודעה שתישלח ללידים..."></textarea></label><div><p class="mb-2 text-sm text-gray-500">הוספת פרטים אישיים</p><div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2"><button type="button" class="press flex min-h-11 items-center rounded-full border border-primary/30 bg-primary-tint px-4 text-sm text-primary-text hover:bg-primary-tint/70 focus:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-primary">שם הליד</button><button type="button" class="press flex min-h-11 items-ce